Track the lowest earlier price and the best profit, evaluating each sale before updating the minimum. Empty, single-price, and non-increasing inputs return zero. Time: O(n); auxiliary space: O(1).

```javascript
function solve(prices) {
  let minPrice = Infinity;
  let bestProfit = 0;

  for (const price of prices) {
    bestProfit = Math.max(bestProfit, price - minPrice);
    minPrice = Math.min(minPrice, price);
  }

  return bestProfit;
}
```

